    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688330/extras/4375931b74712d9726e0350e9b90d6d8.webp?t=1755671752\" width=600 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch up to +140 different fish with unique colors, shapes and designs, collect trash, and trade it for coins. Every 2 hours, your next fishing attempt is guaranteed to grant a fish, which is added to your Steam inventory. You can either release the fish in-game for coins or sell it on the Steam Marketplace.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688330/extras/710d08bbf9a188af9067c002cf20e5a1.poster.avif?t=1755671752\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688330/extras/710d08bbf9a188af9067c002cf20e5a1.webm?t=1755671752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688330/extras/710d08bbf9a188af9067c002cf20e5a1.mp4?t=1755671752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688330/extras/63ba9febaa82156427ed00b707405e6c.webp?t=1755671752\" width=606 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish for trash and exchange the trash for coins, or simply earn coins by freeing fish from your collection, use those coins to buy tons of cosmetics and make your ship look amazing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688330/extras/6b2d562285dc0b6a256aefdf0eb56972.poster.avif?t=1755671752\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688330/extras/6b2d562285dc0b6a256aefdf0eb56972.webm?t=1755671752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688330/extras/6b2d562285dc0b6a256aefdf0eb56972.mp4?t=1755671752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688330/extras/0bf871f21b4edbec37169ec246ac09db.webp?t=1755671752\" width=600 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just enjoy the chill music, cast your line, and grow your collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688330/extras/3138380160f6dabe452e53141911d340.poster.avif?t=1755671752\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688330/extras/3138380160f6dabe452e53141911d340.webm?t=1755671752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688330/extras/3138380160f6dabe452e53141911d340.mp4?t=1755671752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688330/extras/4375931b74712d9726e0350e9b90d6d8.webp?t=1755671752\" width=600 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch up to +140 different fish with unique colors, shapes and designs, collect trash, and trade it for coins. Every 2 hours, your next fishing attempt is guaranteed to grant a fish, which is added to your Steam inventory. You can either release the fish in-game for coins or sell it on the Steam Marketplace.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688330/extras/710d08bbf9a188af9067c002cf20e5a1.poster.avif?t=1755671752\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688330/extras/710d08bbf9a188af9067c002cf20e5a1.webm?t=1755671752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688330/extras/710d08bbf9a188af9067c002cf20e5a1.mp4?t=1755671752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688330/extras/63ba9febaa82156427ed00b707405e6c.webp?t=1755671752\" width=606 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish for trash and exchange the trash for coins, or simply earn coins by freeing fish from your collection, use those coins to buy tons of cosmetics and make your ship look amazing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688330/extras/6b2d562285dc0b6a256aefdf0eb56972.poster.avif?t=1755671752\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688330/extras/6b2d562285dc0b6a256aefdf0eb56972.webm?t=1755671752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688330/extras/6b2d562285dc0b6a256aefdf0eb56972.mp4?t=1755671752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688330/extras/0bf871f21b4edbec37169ec246ac09db.webp?t=1755671752\" width=600 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just enjoy the chill music, cast your line, and grow your collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688330/extras/3138380160f6dabe452e53141911d340.poster.avif?t=1755671752\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688330/extras/3138380160f6dabe452e53141911d340.webm?t=1755671752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688330/extras/3138380160f6dabe452e53141911d340.mp4?t=1755671752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Fishing Time Is a chill fishing game where you collect rare fish. Every 2 hours, you can catch a fish, which is added to your Steam inventory. There are +140 different fish and 6 different rarity levels! Relax, cast your line, and complete your collection!",
